  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Fostering Research and Innovation for Productivity</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fomento a la Investigacin y la Innovacin para la Productividad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo de la primera operacin individual es contribuir a mejorar la productividad, a travs del fomento de la inversin en investigacin e innovacin. Los objetivos especficos de desarrollo son: (i) aumentar las capacidades de investigacin, con nfasis en Cambio Climtico (CC) y orientadas a cerrar brechas territoriales y de gnero; (ii) fortalecer las capacidades de innovacin y emprendimiento del sector privado; e (iii) incrementar y consolidar las capacidades del Sistema Nacional de Ciencia, Tecnologa e Innovacin (SNCTI).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the first operation is to contribute to improve productivity through the fostering of investment in research and innovation. The specific development objectives are: (i) increase the capacities for research with focus in climate change and closing regional and gender gaps ; (ii) strengthen the innovation and start-up capacities of private sector; and (iii) increase and strengthen the capacities of the National Science, Technology, and Innovation System.</narrative>
  </description>
